  "question": {
    "text": "If $f(x)=\\left\\{\\begin{array}{ll}x^2+3 x+a, & x \\leq 1 \\\\ b x+2, & x\\gt1\\end{array}, x \\in \\mathbb{R}\\right.$, is everywhere differentiable, then",
